    "text": "In a building there are <math><mn>15</mn></math> bulbs of <math><mn>45</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\"></mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">W</mi></math> , <math><mn>15</mn></math> bulbs of <math><mn>100</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\"></mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">W</mi><mo>,</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\"></mi><mn>15</mn></math> small fans of <math><mn>10</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\"></mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">W</mi></math> and <math><mn>2</mn></math> heaters of <math><mn>1</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\"></mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">k</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">W</mi></math> . The voltage of electric main supply&nbsp;is <math><mn>220</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\"></mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">V</mi></math> . The minimum fuse capacity (rated value) of the building will be:",
