    "text": "<p>Total power is <math><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>15</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><mn>45</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>15</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><mn>100</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>15</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><mn>10</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><mn>1000</mn></mrow></mfenced></math><br /><math><mo>=</mo><mn>4325</mn><mi></mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">W</mi></math><br />So current <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>4325</mn><mn>220</mn></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>19</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>66</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">A</mi><mo>&#8776;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mn>20</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">A</mi></math></p><p>so we have to use a fuse which can tolerate atleast 20 A current.</p>",
